Changes made: the spreadsheet (10589_2017_9919_MOESM2_ESM.xlsx) was converted
to JSON by benchmarks/tools/convert_breedveld2017_esm.py. Cell values are
unmodified; formula-derived columns (speed-up factors, time per iteration,
column sums) were not converted, and each problem label was annotated with the
matching TROTS case name and tumour site.

